{"id":"a988aea7e719f061","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-speed-up-theorem.md","title":"Speed-up Theorem","display":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-speed-up-theorem","aliases":["72-thm-speed-up-theorem"],"display":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-theory-proof]]","[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]","[[72-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 7.1.1; printed p. 586; PDF p. 598","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Finite proof-search contradiction checked; total-recursive monotone bound and deduction theorem accounted for","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-speed-up-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-speed-up-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-speed-up-theorem — Speed-up Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 7.1.1; printed p. 586; PDF p. 598"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Finite proof-search contradiction checked; total-recursive monotone bound and deduction theorem accounted for"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是具有固定有效有限字母表表示的一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathcal F:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathsf{Sent}:=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B\">\\(A\\to B:=\\neg A\\lor B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LogAx}_L,\\operatorname{LogRules}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{LogAx}_L,\\operatorname{LogRules}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5f45b7be0b2d491\" href=\"?note=f5f45b7be0b2d491\" title=\"72-df-theory-proof\">72-df-theory-proof</a> 的有限前提演算，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LogAx}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}\">\\(\\operatorname{LogAx}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ax}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LogRules}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf R\">\\(\\operatorname{LogRules}_L\\subseteq\\mathsf R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本演算满足句子演绎条件：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ [(U\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}B)\\leftrightarrow(U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}A\\to B)]\">\\(\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\ [(U\\cup\\{A\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}B)\\leftrightarrow(U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}A\\to B)]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为上述同一演算的有限公式序列接口；不另加入未编码的公理证书。</li>\n<li>固定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fcode}:\\mathcal F\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{fcode}:\\mathcal F\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathcal F^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。相对于给定有限字母表表示，这两个编码及其合法码解析可计算，非法码可判定；命题联结词的形成可计算。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{T,T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{T,T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}\\}\\)</span>，编码上的有限证明检验可判定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|:=|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\">\\(|\\pi|:=|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\)</span>；位长有界的候选证明码为可有效穷举的有限集合。</li>\n<li>总递归函数图谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(U)\\)</span> 与单自然数输入函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}))\">\\(\\neg\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 为大于所有自然数的附加元素。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi_D&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,1\\rangle:n\\in D\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,0\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\setminus D\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(D)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_D,1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(U)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{fcode}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\land U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rec}&amp;:=\\{f\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\},1)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi_D&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,1\\rangle:n\\in D\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,0\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\setminus D\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Dec}_\\omega(D)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_D,1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ThCode}_{\\mathcal C}(U)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{fcode}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\land U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Rec}&amp;:=\\{f\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\operatorname{TotalRecFun}(\\{\\langle\\langle n\\rangle,f(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\},1)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad T+\\neg\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T+\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad T+\\neg\\alpha:=T\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_U(\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\},&amp;U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;U\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(U\\in\\{T,T+\\alpha\\},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_U(\\varphi)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(U,\\pi,\\varphi)\\},&amp;U\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;U\\nvdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad(U\\in\\{T,T+\\alpha\\},\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\cap\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\;\n\\mu_T(\\varphi)\\leq f(\\mu_{T+\\alpha}(\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{Sent}\\cap\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\;\n\\mu_T(\\varphi)\\leq f(\\mu_{T+\\alpha}(\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 7.1.1（Ehrenfeucht and Mycielski [1971]），印刷页 586，PDF 页 598；本次核对了陈述及该页证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原来的量词条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T+\\alpha\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>，会把没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明的句子也纳入比较，甚至使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_T\">\\(\\mu_T\\)</span> 未定义。原书只比较已经在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可证的句子，现已恢复。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>证明复核：若有递归界，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\alpha\\vdash\\psi\">\\(T+\\neg\\alpha\\vdash\\psi\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\alpha\\lor\\psi\">\\(T\\vdash\\alpha\\lor\\psi\\)</span>。后者一旦成立，就由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\alpha\">\\(T+\\alpha\\)</span> 中统一可构造的短证明及假定界得到可计算的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明搜索上界，从而判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\alpha\">\\(T+\\neg\\alpha\\)</span> 的定理集合，矛盾。可将候选界取为单调闭包，并计入书中省略的固定编码常数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This is the Ehrenfeucht–Mycielski no-recursive-bound form; mere inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1\\subseteq S_2\">\\(S_1\\subseteq S_2\\)</span> does not by itself imply speed-up.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第二轮按理论定理集合限制量化域，保证对总递归函数 f 的每个实参均为自然数，不在无穷值上调用 f。上游以 lh(π) 表示序列项数，此处 |π| 仅表示固定证明编码大小。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-theory-proof","status":"resolved","id":"f5f45b7be0b2d491","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-theory-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location"